<title>USA: Premiere Radio Q3 shr rises to $0.14.</title>
<headline>Premiere Radio Q3 shr rises to $0.14.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>PREMIERE RADIO NETWORKS, INC.</p>
<p>				  FINANCIAL DATA TABLE</p>
<p>			  (Unaudited)</p>
<p>			Three Months Ended     Nine Months Ended</p>
<p>			  September 30,	     September 30,</p>
<p>			 1996	 1995	  1996	  1995</p>
<p>Gross revenue  $7,069,000 $5,651,000 $19,143,000 $15,014,000</p>
<p>Net operating revenue</p>
<p>		     6,213,000  5,032,000  16,786,000  13,305,000</p>
